ed professional textbooks, folders, loose papers, an open storage box, and a slim black adjustable desk lamp angled downward. The lower-left foreground includes part of a wooden chair with a curved backrest, positioned near the desk. On the right side, a second matching loft bed runs parallel to the wall, its upper bunk neatly made with blue-and-white striped bedding and its lower desk area partially visible. The back wall contains a light wood three-tier bookshelf near the door, filled with rows of professional books and framed certificates or awards. Above and beside the shelf, a course schedule sheet and several sticky notes are pinned to the wall. A square white LED ceiling light glows at the center of the ceiling, casting soft, natural-looking illumination that mixes with cool sunlight entering through the south-facing window on the right. Near the door, hooks hold a backpack and outerwear, adding lived-in detail. One bed is neatly made while the other is visibly disheveled, reinforcing the contrast between order and daily student life. The overall atmosphere is quiet, academic, clean, and slightly cool, with realistic material textures, accurate shadows, and cinematic depth."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [538.0350341796875, 344.864501953125], "pos": [1246.233154296875, 2975.58056640625], "id": 484, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [686], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_v